>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- 
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- Some children saw Nasreddin coming from the vineyard with two
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- baskets full of grapes loaded on his donkey. They gathered around
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- him and asked him to give them a taste.  Nasreddin picked up a
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- bunch of grapes and gave each child a grape.  "You have so much,
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- but you gave us so little," the children whined.  "There is no
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- difference whether you have a basketful or a small piece. They
>> :punch.wa.us.dal.net 372 elfoo :- all taste the same," Nasreddin answered, and continued on his way.
